# HKProperty environment variable names (no secrets)

## Frontend (Vite, public)

- `VITE_POCKETBASE_URL` — PocketBase public URL for staff/admin **login SDK only** (auth). Public borrow must go through `/api/*`, not direct collection reads.
- `VITE_ENABLE_TEST_MODE` — optional local demo mode (`true`/`false`)

Do **not** put service passwords in any `VITE_` variable.

## Vercel Serverless Runtime (private)

- `POCKETBASE_URL` — PocketBase base URL
- `POCKETBASE_SERVICE_EMAIL` — `hkp_staff_users` account with `role=service`
- `POCKETBASE_SERVICE_PASSWORD` — service account password

## Local scripts only (never deploy)

- `POCKETBASE_ADMIN_EMAIL` — superuser for schema migrations / audits
- `POCKETBASE_ADMIN_PASSWORD` — superuser password

Admin credentials must not be used as the website service account.
